{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ve organized the game content and Q&amp;A to help players quickly figure out if it\u2019s right for them! No need to waste everyone\u2019s time!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The English part of the fourth level has not yet been translated)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Composition</strong>: 70% stationary shooting &quot;horde-slaying&quot; + 30% absurd humor (The content contains a touch of &quot;hell jokes&quot; (i.e., dark humor with morbid or taboo undertones).).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Flow</strong>: A single round lasts about 5\u201320 minutes. Current total gameplay duration is approximately 2\u20133 hours (the game is not yet complete).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM</strong>: Mostly phonk-style music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style</strong>: As shown in the image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC Performance Requirements</strong>: None! If your computer can run 4399 games, it\u2019ll basically run this without lag.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Roguelike Elements</strong>: Low replay value, as it\u2019s a linear level-based game.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744910?t=1757140414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744910?t=1757140414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744910/330382ae6a34e821c03817b26e118899bea89e19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757140414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744910/330382ae6a34e821c03817b26e118899bea89e19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757140414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=